OL,3,ASearch for survivors after 16 killed by
OL,4,ARussian double-tap strike on Ukraine
OL,5,Amall
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, officials said at least two
OL,8,Fpeople had been killed by further
OL,9,FRussian strikes overnight. The defence
OL,10,Fministry in Moscow said it had targeted
OL,11,Ftransport infrastructure and warehouses
OL,12,Fin the Kyiv region.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
